riority int                    Set priority\n      --remove-depends-on stringArray   Remove dependency on issue ID (repeatable)\n      --remove-label stringArray        Remove label (repeatable); other labels are preserved\n      --status string                   Set status\n      --title string                    Set title\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --backend string      AI backend CLI to use (codex, claude, opencode). Env: LOOM_BACKEND\n      --log-format string   Log format (text|json) (default \"text\")\n      --log-output string   Log output destination (stderr|<filepath>) (default \"stderr\")\n  -o, --output string       Output format: text|json (default \"text\")\n      --server string       Loom server base URL (or LOOM_SERVER_URL env var)\n      --workspace string    Workspace ID. Env: LOOM_WORKSPACE\nAdd a comment to an issue (HTTP)\n\nUsage:\n  loom data comment <issue-id> <text> [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --author string   Comment author (defaults to server-side session user)\n  -h, --help            help for comment\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --backend string      AI backend CLI to use (codex, claude, opencode). Env: LOOM_BACKEND\n      --log-format string   Log format (text|json) (default \"text\")\n      --log-output string   Log output destination (stderr|<filepath>) (default \"stderr\")\n  -o, --output string       Output format: text|json (default \"text\")\n      --server string       Loom server base URL (or LOOM_SERVER_URL env var)\n      --workspace string    Workspace ID. Env: LOOM_WORKSPACE\ntime=2026-08-22T22:17:59.740Z level=INFO msg=\"opened existing embedded fleet-db client\" url=http://127.0.0.1:44829\n['id', 'title', 'status', 'priority', 'issue_type', 'owner', 'has_design', 'created_at', 'updated_at', 'created_by', 'description', 'dependents']\nnotes= None\ndesign= None\n","localExecutionTimeMs":1372},"isBackground":false},"description":"Inspect /app, deps, sibling task specs"},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-071fc611-cb56-4133-