{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-c5d05e27-e315-4004-b1a8-0efb674e2ad9-16\nfc_5a444d59-342f-96c9-a2c0-30630e532a77_0","tool_call":{"shellToolCall":{"args":{"command":"for id in MARATHON-3 MARATHON-4 MARATHON-5 MARATHON-16; do echo \"===== $id =====\"; loom data show $id 2>/dev/null | sed -n '1,80p'; done","workingDirectory":"","timeout":30000,"toolCallId":"call-c5d05e27-e315-4004-b1a8-0efb674e2ad9-16\nfc_5a444d59-342f-96c9-a2c0-30630e532a77_0","simpleCommands":["echo","loom","sed"],"hasInputRedirect":false,"hasOutputRedirect":true,"parsingResult":{"parsingFailed":false,"executableCommands":[{"name":"echo","args":[{"type":"string","value":"\"===== $id =====\""}],"fullText":"echo \"===== $id =====\""},{"name":"loom","args":[{"type":"word","value":"data"},{"type":"word","value":"show"},{"type":"simple_expansion","value":"$id"}],"fullText":"loom data show $id"},{"name":"sed","args":[{"type":"word","value":"-n"},{"type":"raw_string","value":"'1,80p'"}],"fullText":"sed -n '1,80p'"}],"hasRedirects":true,"hasCommandSubstitution":false,"allRedirectsAreDevNull":true,"redirects":[{"operator":">","destinationFds":[2],"targetNodeType":"word","targetText":"/dev/null"}]},"fileOutputThresholdBytes":"40000","isBackground":false,"skipApproval":false,"timeoutBehavior":"TIMEOUT_BEHAVIOR_BACKGROUND","hardTimeout":86400000,"description":"Show auth-related task descriptions","closeStdin":true,"conversationId":"16441d7e-4536-4690-9540-dd9713c2d9a1","adminCommandDenylist":[]},"result":{"success":{"command":"for id in MARATHON-3 MARATHON-4 MARATHON-5 MARATHON-16; do echo \"===== $id =====\"; loom data show $id 2>/dev/null | sed -n '1,80p'; done","workingDirectory":"","exitCode":0,"signal":"","stdout":"===== MARATHON-3 =====\nID:       MARATHON-3\nTitle:    Auth API: register, login, me, bearer tokens\nStatus:   in_progress\nPriority: 0\nType:     task\nAssignee: app-architect-1\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect backend]\n\nDescription:\nImplement POST /api/auth/register, POST /api/auth/login, GET /api/auth/me per contract. Username URL-safe slug; password >=8; 201 {user,token} with token length >=16; duplicate username 409; invalid username/short password 400; wrong password 401; missing/invalid bearer 401. No email field. Persist users and tokens cluster-wide so any node accepts the same token.\n===== MARATHON-4 =====\nID:       MARATHON-4\nTitle:    Profiles API: UserObj get and patch me\nStatus:   open\nPriority: 1\nType:     task\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect backend]\n\nDescription:\nUserObj: {id, username, display_name, timezone, avatar_url, status_text, status_emoji}. GET /api/users/{id} → 200 {user} or 404. PATCH /api/users/me accepts any subset; invalid timezone or out-of-range lengths → 400. Profile updates should be ready to broadcast as user.updated over WebSocket later (no channel_id/seq).\n===== MARATHON-5 =====\nID:       MARATHON-5\nTitle:    Workspaces: create, list, detail, auto #general\nStatus:   open\nPriority: 0\nType:     task\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect backend]\n\nDescription:\nWorkspaceObj {id, slug, name, owner_id, join_mode} with join_mode open|invite_only default open. POST /api/workspaces {slug,name} → 201 {workspace, general_channel}; slug kebab ^[a-z0-9-]{2,32}$; duplicate slug 409; creator is owner; auto-create #general. GET /api/workspaces → member/owned list. GET /api/workspaces/{slug} → {workspace, channels, read_state}; omit private channels caller is not in; ?include_archived=1 supported.\n===== MARATHON-16 =====\nID:       MARATHON-16\nTitle:    SPA: auth, token storage, workspace shell\nStatus:   open\nPriority: 1\nType:     task\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect frontend]\n\nDescription:\nServe SPA from GET / on any node. Sign-up form with visible error on invalid input; auto-login on success. Logout/login restores same workspace. Store bearer in localStorage huddle.token (or accepted fallbacks). Three-pane layout shell: coloured sidebar + message pane + on-demand thread panel. Workspace identity in sidebar. Stable selectors: auth-form, auth-submit, auth-toggle, auth-modal, workspace-create-form, empty-state-create-workspace, join-workspace-*, current-user, logout-btn, workspace-header, channel-list, dms-list. Drivable at 1280x900.\n","stderr":"","executionTime":5470,"interleavedOutput":"===== MARATHON-3 =====\nID:       MARATHON-3\nTitle:    Auth API: register, login, me, bearer tokens\nStatus:   in_progress\nPriority: 0\nType:     task\nAssignee: app-architect-1\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect backend]\n\nDescription:\nImplement POST /api/auth/register, POST /api/auth/login, GET /api/auth/me per contract. Username URL-safe slug; password >=8; 201 {user,token} with token length >=16; duplicate username 409; invalid username/short password 400; wrong password 401; missing/invalid bearer 401. No email field. Persist users and tokens cluster-wide so any node accepts the same token.\n===== MARATHON-4 =====\nID:       MARATHON-4\nTitle:    Profiles API: UserObj get and patch me\nStatus:   open\nPriority: 1\nType:     task\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect backend]\n\nDescription:\nUserObj: {id, username, display_name, timezone, avatar_url, status_text, status_emoji}. GET /api/users/{id} → 200 {user} or 404. PATCH /api/users/me accepts any subset; invalid timezone or out-of-range lengths → 400. Profile updates should be ready to broadcast as user.updated over WebSocket later (no channel_id/seq).\n===== MARATHON-5 =====\nID:       MARATHON-5\nTitle:    Workspaces: create, list, detail, auto #general\nStatus:   open\nPriority: 0\nType:     task\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect backend]\n\nDescription:\nWorkspaceObj {id, slug, name, owner_id, join_mode} with join_mode open|invite_only default open. POST /api/workspaces {slug,name} → 201 {workspace, general_channel}; slug kebab ^[a-z0-9-]{2,32}$; duplicate slug 409; creator is owner; auto-create #general. GET /api/workspaces → member/owned list. GET /api/workspaces/{slug} → {workspace, channels, read_state}; omit private channels caller is not in; ?include_archived=1 supported.\n===== MARATHON-16 =====\nID:       MARATHON-16\nTitle:    SPA: auth, token storage, workspace shell\nStatus:   open\nPriority: 1\nType:     task\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect frontend]\n\nDescription:\nServe SPA from GET / on any node. Sign-up form with visible error on invalid input; auto-login on success. Logout/login restores same workspace. Store bearer in localStorage huddle.token (or accepted fallbacks). Three-pane layout shell: coloured sidebar + message pane + on-demand thread panel. Workspace identity in sidebar. Stable selectors: auth-form, auth-submit, auth-toggle, auth-modal, workspace-create-form, empty-state-create-workspace, join-workspace-*, current-user, logout-btn, workspace-header, channel-list, dms-list. Drivable at 1280x900.\n","localExecutionTimeMs":3168},"isBackground":false},"description":"Show auth-related task descriptions"},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-c5d05e27-e315-4004-b1a8-0efb674e2ad9-16\nfc_5a444d59-342f-96c9-a2c0-30630e532a77_0","startedAtMs":"1787437901035","completedAtMs":"1787437906517"},"model_call_id":"27706bf9-ff04-456c-bd68-272e2e73b175-4-jxa4","session_id":"16441d7e-4536-4690-9540-dd9713c2d9a1","timestamp_ms":1787437906550}
