{"lineNumber":66,"content":"  \"avatar_url\": null,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":67,"content":"  \"status_text\": null,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":68,"content":"  \"status_emoji\": null","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":76,"content":"| `display_name` | string | required | On register, default to `username` if omitted |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":77,"content":"| `timezone` | string \\| null | nullable | Auth leaves `null`; MARATHON-4 validates IANA names on PATCH |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":78,"content":"| `avatar_url` | string \\| null | nullable | Auth leaves `null` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":79,"content":"| `status_text` | string \\| null | nullable | Auth leaves `null` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":80,"content":"| `status_emoji` | string \\| null | nullable | Auth leaves `null` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":103,"content":"- Pattern: `^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{1,31}$` (length **2–32**).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":110,"content":"- Minimum length **8** (codepoints / UTF-8 string length).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":111,"content":"- Maximum length **128** (400 if longer — DoS guard; not in grader wording but required for implementers).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":127,"content":"| **Client (SPA / grader)** | JSON body `{ \"username\": string, \"password\": string }`. Optional `display_name` allowed; ignore unknown fields or reject — **server must ignore unknown fields** (forward-compatible). While waiting: disable submit / show pending. On 400/409: show `error.message`. On 201: store `token` (SPA: `localStorage` key `huddle.token` — owned by MARATHON-16) and treat `user` as session user. |","con