A / replace `GET /` | MARATHON-16 |\n| Member list/PATCH/transfer routes | MARATHON-6 |\n| Channel create/join/leave/archive/pins routes | MARATHON-7 |\n| Read POST/GET routes, search, slash | MARATHON-11 |\n\n## Sequencing and Cross-Task Seams\n\n### Build order (single implementer)\n\n1. `db.py` migration v2 (+ reverse for tests if pattern continues).\n2. `server/channels/store.py` + `server/workspaces/store.py`.\n3. `server/workspaces/routes.py` + wire `app.py`.\n4. Broaden `errors.py` validation paths.\n5. `tests/test_workspaces.py`.\n\n### Parallelism\n\n- Channel store vs workspace store can proceed in parallel after migration DDL is known.\n- Tests after routes.\n\n### Downstream seams this task owns\n\n| Contract | Consumed by |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `WorkspaceObj` + `/api/workspaces` create/list/detail | MARATHON-6, 7, 12, 16, 18 |\n| `ChannelObj` JSON + `channels` / `channel_members` tables | MARATHON-7, 8, 9, 11, 13, 17 |\n| Auto `#general` with `name=\"general\"` | SPA default channel; IRC/bridge later |\n| `join_mode` column default `open` | MARATHON-6 PATCH; MARATHON-7 join rules |\n| `workspace_members.role` including `owner` | MARATHON-6 |\n| Embedded `read_state[]` shape | MARATHON-11 (writes); MARATHON-16 (display badges later) |\n| 404-for-non-members detail policy | SPA routing |\n\n### Upstream\n\n- **MARATHON-3** (closed): users, bearer, envelope — required.\n- **MARATHON-2** (closed): shared DB / app factory.\n\n### Must land before\n\n- MARATHON-6, 7, 16 (declared blockers/dependents).\n\n### Follow-up cuts (do not implement here)\n\n- Members list, role PATCH, ownership transfer → MARATHON-6.\n- Extra channels, join/leave, archive, pins → MARATHON-7.","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":485,"fileSize":23740,"path":"/tmp/MARATHON-5-design.md","readRange":{"startLine":300,"endLine":379},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-7a2ab7d9-cd7c-4d9c-93ad-3a7fe01c0