kend-dev-1--99c51c28/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":64,"content":"Create /app/start.sh that stays in the foreground and keeps the cluster serving while alive. Launch three HTTP nodes on 127.0.0.1:8000, :8001, :8002 and a local redis-server on 127.0.0.1:6379. Self-contained (no remote services, no DinD). Respawning: if an HTTP node is SIGKILLed it must come back within 60s without external action; if Redis is SIGKILLed, start.sh must respawn it. Stub GET / on each node and GET /api/health returning 200 {status:ok, node_id} with node_id 0/1/2 matching ports 8000/8001/8002. Choose language/framework and shared durable storage layout for the cluster.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":71,"content":"This task boots the Huddle cluster so the verifier (and every later feature task) has a live, self-contained process tree: `/app/start.sh` stays in the foreground, supervises a local Redis on `127.0.0.1:6379` and three identical HTTP nodes on `127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002`, and respawns any of those children after `SIGKILL`. Each node exposes a stub `GET /` and the contracted `GET /api/health`. The design also locks language/framework and the shared durable storage layout that Auth, messages, fan-out, IRC, and the SPA will all assume.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":109,"content":"3. `node_id` ∈ `{0,1,2}` ↔ ports `{8000,8001,8002}` (never swap).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":123,"content":"| **Client / grader** | `GET http://127.0.0.1:800{N}/api/health` ","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-221719-app-architect-1--6d8c9266/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":67,"content":"Create /app/start.sh that stays in the foreground and keeps the cluster serving while alive. Launch three HTTP nodes on 127.0.0.1:8000, :8001, :8002 and a local redis-server on 127.0.0.1:6379. Self-contained (no remote services, no DinD). Respawning: if an HTTP node is SIGKILLed it must come back within 60s without external action; if Redis is SIGKILLed, start.sh must respawn it. Stub GET / on each node and GET /api/health returning 200 {status:ok, node_id} with node_id 0/1/2 matching ports 8000/8001/8002. Choose language/framework and shared durable storage layout for the cluster.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":10,"totalMatchedLines":10,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false,"headLimitApplied":40}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-7a2ab7d9-cd7c-4d9c-93ad-3a7fe01c04ef-27\nfc_adbe8e61-7180-9b6f-b1e7-b2e69b332d50_1","startedAtMs":"1787438951318","completedAtMs":"1787438953257"},"model_call_id":"52c7e569-f580-424e-9bd3-33cce841899c-7-qiah","session_id":"a3bad295-2ca9-4573-bf75-ec471b6d0b93","timestamp_ms":1787438953281}
