app. Verifier runs /app/start.sh (foreground) which must keep serving while alive.\\n\\nExpose HTTP nodes on 127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002, IRC on :6667, browser UI at GET /. Local Redis pub/sub on :6379. No remote services, no DinD, no Slack SDK.\\n\\nProduct: auth, profiles, workspaces, invitations, roles, public/private channels, DMs, messages, threads, reactions, pins, files, search, user groups, slash commands, mentions, read state, settings, SPA.\\n\\nCluster: dense per-channel seq shared across HTTP+IRC; replay after reconnect to different node; fan-out across nodes; survive one HTTP node SIGKILL (respawn \\u003c60s); survive Redis SIGKILL with continued dense fan-out within 5s then Redis respawn.\\n\\nAPI: REST + bearer auth, JSON envelopes, stable ids, UTC timestamps. UI: stable data-testid/selectors for CUA/Playwright at 1280x900.\",\n  \"dependents\": [\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-10\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Files: upload, metadata, download, attach\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 2,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:17:16.937791398Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-11\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Search, slash commands, mentions, read state\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:17:16.95794646Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-12\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"User groups and workspace invitations\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:17:16.983999583Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-13\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"WebSocket subscribe/resume and dense channel seq\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:17:29.968254993Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-14\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Cross-node fan-out and Redis-outage resilience\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:17:29.988892308Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-15\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"IRC gateway on :6667 with bidirectional bridge\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:17:47.158664008Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-16\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"SPA: auth, token storage, workspace shell\",\n      \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:17:47.179119571Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-17\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"SPA: channels, messages, threads, reactions\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:17:47.201025306Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-18\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHO