= frozenset({\"open\", \"invite_only\"})","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-234424-app-architect-1--56b8fed5/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":67,"content":"ChannelObj {id,workspace_id,name,is_private,is_dm,topic,is_archived}; topic default \\\"\\\", max 250. POST workspaces/{slug}/channels; name kebab <=32; duplicate 409. Role rules: guest cannot join public or create channels (403); member cannot create private (403); private create admin/owner. Join: open workspace auto-onboards non-members; invite_only non-members 403; private without invite 403. leave idempotent; members list; PATCH topic (member or workspace owner); archive/unarchive owner-only; archived writes → 423. Pins: GET channels/{id}/pins; POST/DELETE messages/{id}/pin per contract.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/backend-dev-1/tests/test_workspace_members.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":210,"content":"        json={\"join_mode\": \"invite_only\"},","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":213,"content":"    assert resp.json()[\"workspace\"][\"join_mode\"] == \"invite_only\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/backend-dev-1/server/workspaces/store.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":16,"content":"JOIN_MODES = frozenset({\"open\", \"invite_only\"})","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-233543-backend-dev-1--5fd5e7e5/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":71,"content":"This task completes workspace tenancy beyond create/list/detail (MARATHON-5): authenticated **members** can list workspace membership; **admins/owners** can PATCH `name` / `join_mode`; **admins/owners** can change other members’ roles under a strict hierarchy; and the **owner** alone can transfer ownership to an existing **admin** (previous owner becomes admin). It locks `MemberObj`, the four REST seams SPA settings (MARATHON-18) and channel/invitation authz (MARATHON-7/12) depend on, and keeps `workspaces.owner_id` synchronized with `workspace_members.role='owner'`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":119,"content":"From **MARATHON-5**: `WorkspaceObj` exact keys; `validate_name` / slug rules; membership gate → 404; `join_mode` ∈ {`open`,`invite_only`}; roles ∈ {`owner`,`admin`,`member`,`guest`}; `forbidden` reserved for role rules.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/frontend-dev-1/tests/test_workspaces.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":74,"content":"        json={\"slug\": \"acme\", \"name\": \"Acme Corp\", \"join_mode\": \"invite_only\", \"x\": 1},","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/frontend-dev-1/server/db.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":110,"content":"                CHECK (join_mode IN ('open', 'invite_only')),","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/app-architect-1/tests/test_workspaces.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":74,"content":"        json={\"slug\": \"acme\", \"name\": \"Acme Corp\", \"join_mode\": \"invite_only\", \"x\": 1},","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/app-architect-1/server/db.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":110,"content":"                CHECK (join_mode IN ('open', 'invite_only')),","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/backend-dev-1/tests/test_workspaces.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":74,"content":"        json={\"slug\": \"acme\", \"name\": \"Acme Corp\", \"join_mode\": \"invite_only\", \"x\": 1},","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/backend-dev-1/server/db.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":110,"content":"                CHECK (join_mode IN ('open', 'invite_only')),","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-230008-backend-dev-1--cfebd2ac/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":64,"content":"WorkspaceObj {id, slug, name, owner_id, join_mode} with join_mode open|invite_only default open. POST /api/workspaces {slug,name} → 201 {workspace, general_channel}; slug kebab ^[a-z0-9-]{2,32}$; duplicate slug 409; creator is owner; auto-create #general. GET /api/workspaces → member/owned list. GET /api/workspaces/{slug} → {workspace, channels, read_state}; omit private channels caller is not in; ?include_archived=1 supported.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":94,"content":"- Epic requires workspaces before channels, invitations, and the SPA shell. Without durable membership + `#general`, MARATHON-6/7/16 have no seam.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-225358-app-architect-1--52da21f4/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":67,"content":"WorkspaceObj {id, slug, name, owner_id, join_mode} with join_mode open|invite_only default open. POST /api/workspaces {slug,name} → 201 {workspace, general_channel}; slug kebab ^[a-z0-9-]{2,32}$; duplicate slug 409; creator is owner; auto-create #general. GET /api/workspaces → member/owned list. GET /api/workspaces/{slug} → {workspace, channels, read_state}; omit private channels caller is not in; ?include_archived=1 supported.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":94,"content":"- Epic requires workspaces before channels, invitations, and the SPA shell. Without durable membership + `#general`, MARATHON-6/7/16 have no seam.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-224450-app-architect-1--d78bac5a/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":67,"content":"WorkspaceObj {id, slug, name, owner_id, join_mode} with join_mode open|invite_only default open. POST /api/workspaces {slug,name} → 201 {workspace, general_channel}; slug kebab ^[a-z0-9-]{2,32}$; duplicate slug 409; creator is owner; auto-create #general. GET /api/workspaces → member/owned list. GET /ap