ces/{slug}/join`) that MARATHON-16 already calls. It locks the `/api/channels/*` and pin REST contracts, introduces migration **v3** (`messages` minimal + `channel_pins`), and exports a shared **archived-write guard** (`423`) that MARATHON-8/11 must reuse.\n\n## Technical Approach\n\n### Decision\n\n| Concern | Choice |\n|--------|--------|\n| Persistence | Shared SQLite SoT; **migration version 3** additive: minimal `messages` + `channel_pins` (pins need message rows; same “schema-ahead” pattern as M5 channels-before-CRUD) |\n| Route layout | (1) Extend `server/workspaces/routes.py`: `POST \n\n=== find 'Workspace join' at 501 ===\nch topic, archive/unarchive (owner-only), and pin/unpin messages. It also implements the SPA-locked workspace join seam (`POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join`) that MARATHON-16 already calls. It locks the `/api/channels/*` and pin REST contracts, introduces migration **v3** (`messages` minimal + `channel_pins`), and exports a shared **archived-write guard** (`423`) that MARATHON-8/11 must reuse.\n\n## Technical Approach\n\n### Decision\n\n| Concern | Choice |\n|--------|--------|\n| Persistence | Shared SQLite SoT; **migration version 3** additive: minimal `messages` + `channel_pins` (pins need message rows; same “schema-ahead” pattern as M5 channels-before-CRUD) |\n| Route layout | (1) Extend `server/workspaces/routes.py`: `POST /{slug}/join`, `POST /{slug}/channels`. (2) New `server/channels/routes.py` prefix `/api/channels`: join, leave, PATCH, members, archive, unarchive, pins. (3) New `server/m\n\n=== find 'POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join' at 523 ===\nchive (owner-only), and pin/unpin messages. It also implements the SPA-locked workspace join seam (`POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join`) that MARATHON-16 already calls. It locks the `/api/channels/*` and pin REST contracts, introduces migration **v3** (`messages` minimal + `channel_pins`), and exports a shared **archived-write guard** (`423`) that MARATHON-8/11 must reuse.\n\n## Technical A