w \"$tid\"\n  echo\ndone\n# Check loom data update help for design size limits\nloom data update --help 2>&1 | head -50\n","workingDirectory":"","exitCode":0,"signal":"","stdout":"==== MARATHON-11 ====\nID:       MARATHON-11\nTitle:    Search, slash commands, mentions, read state\nStatus:   open\nPriority: 1\nType:     task\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect backend]\n\nDescription:\nGET /api/search?q=&workspace_id=. Slash commands as message body: /me, /shrug, /topic, /invite @user, /archive, /unarchive; unknown and /me without text → 400; //literal posts literally; side-effect cmds return 201 message:null + channel/invited_user. Mentions: @username, @group-handle, @channel, @here rules per spec; no self mention_count. GET/POST /api/channels/{id}/read for read_state; never move cursor backwards; workspace detail embeds same shape.\n\n==== MARATHON-18 ====\nID:       MARATHON-18\nTitle:    SPA: workspace and channel settings UI\nStatus:   open\nPriority: 2\nType:     task\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect frontend]\n\nDescription:\nWorkspace settings modal: tabs general/members/invitations; name/join_mode; member rows with role-badge/role-select; create invitation form and list with invitation-code. Channel settings: members list/add, topic, archive/unarchive. DOM ids: channel-settings-modal, workspace-settings-modal, create-invitation-form. All settings-* and invitation-* testids from frontend hooks.\n\nUpdate issue fields\n\nUsage:\n  loom data update <issue-id> [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --add-label stringArray           Add label (repeatable); other labels are preserved\n      --assignee string                 Set assignee\n      --depends-on stringArray          Add dependency on issue ID (repeatable)\n      --description string              Set description\n      --description-from-file string    Read description from file (use - for stdin)\n      --design string                   Set des