` | integer | required | ≥ 1 |\n114:| `invited_user_id` | string \\| null | nullable | Set iff targeted |\n115:| `invited_username` | string \\| null | nullable | Denormalized at create for SPA list; null if open invite |\n140:{ \"handle\": \"eng-leads\", \"name\": \"Eng Leads\", \"user_ids\": [\"…\"] }\n143:- `user_ids` optional; default `[]`. Unknown keys ignored.\n144:- Every id in `user_ids` must be a **current workspace member** → else **400** `validation_error`.\n159:{ \"name\": \"New Name\", \"user_ids\": [\"…\", \"…\"] }\n161:- If `user_ids` present: **replace** full membership set (empty array clears).\n187:  \"expires_in_seconds\": 86400,\n188:  \"max_uses\": 1,\n189:  \"invited_username\": \"ada\",\n190:  \"invited_user_id\": null\n197:| `expires_in_seconds` | Omit/null → no expiry. If set: integer **≥ 60** and **≤ 2592000** (30d); else 400. `expires_at = now + seconds`. |\n198:| `max_uses` | Omit → **1**. If set: integer **≥ 1** and **≤ 1000**; else 400. |\n199:| `invited_user_id` | If set: must exist in `users`; else 400. |\n200:| `invited_username` | If set: resolve via username (case-sensitive per Auth store); unknown → 400. |\n202:| Targeted | Force `max_uses = 1`. If client sends `max_uses` > 1 with a target → **400** `validation_error`. |\n211:**Semantics — active only:** `revoked_at IS NULL` AND (`expires_at IS NULL` OR `expires_at > now`) AND `use_count < max_uses`.\n229:| Expired (`expires_at <= now`) | 404 | `not_found` |\n230:| Exhausted (`use_count >= max_uses`) | 404 | `not_found` |\n231:| Targeted and caller.id ≠ invited_user_id | **403** | `forbidden` |\n282:| `validation_error` | 400 | Bad handle/name/user_ids/expiry/max_uses/target mismatch |\n325:| `expires_at` | TEXT NULL | |\n326:| `max_uses` | INTEGER NOT NULL | |\n328:| `invited_user_id` | TEXT NULL | FK users |\n329:| `invited_username` | TEXT NULL | snapshot at create |\n334:**No changes** to `workspaces.join_mode` CHECK or `workspace_members` schema.\n400:- MARATHON-5/6 closed (w