atus': 'in_progress', 'issue_type': 'task', 'created_at': '2026-08-22T22:17:16.962464474Z', 'created_by': 'marathon-harness'}]\nGET /api/search?q=&workspace_id=. Slash commands as message body: /me, /shrug, /topic, /invite @user, /archive, /unarchive; unknown and /me without text → 400; //literal posts literally; side-effect cmds return 201 message:null + channel/invited_user. Mentions: @username, @group-handle, @channel, @here rules per spec; no self mention_count. GET/POST /api/channels/{id}/read for read_state; never move cursor backwards; workspace detail embeds same shape.\nhas_design: False\n============================================================\nMARATHON-13 WebSocket subscribe/resume and dense channel seq\nlabels: ['architect', 'backend']\ndeps: [{'issue_id': 'MARATHON-13', 'depends_on_id': 'MARATHON-8', 'type': 'blocks', 'title': 'Messages, threads, reactions REST API', 'status': 'in_progress', 'issue_type': 'task', 'created_at': '2026-08-22T22:17:29.97263884Z', 'created_by': 'marathon-harness'}]\nws://host/api/ws?token= bearer. Client: subscribe, resume with since_seq. Server: subscribed/resumed with head_seq; resume.gap if since_seq older than retained tail. Durable per-channel frames {type, seq, channel_id, ...} for message/reply/reaction/membership/channel mutations. seq dense per-channel (+1 per durable event, no gaps/duplicates). Profile updates: {type:user.updated,user} globally without channel_id/seq. Same seq visible across all HTTP nodes (fan-out task will complete cross-node).\nhas_design: False\n============================================================\nMARATHON-17 SPA: channels, messages, threads, reactions\nlabels: ['architect', 'frontend']\ndeps: [{'issue_id': 'MARATHON-17', 'depends_on_id': 'MARATHON-8', 'type': 'blocks', 'title': 'Messages, threads, reactions REST API', 'status': 'in_progress', 'issue_type': 'task', 'created_at': '2026-08-22T22:17:47.207494951Z', 'created_by': 'marathon-harness'}]\nChannel list/create/switch; duplicate-name validation; data-channel-id/name on entries; hashtag-prefixed names; channel header name+topic; empty-channel non-blank copy. Messages: post/edit/delete via hover-toolbar; edited indicator; survive hard reload; empty-message validation. Message rows: avatar+author+human-readable timestamp+body. Threads: right-side panel; bump N replies. Reactions via emoji-picker grid (not prompt()); reaction badge with count. Pinned testids: channel-*, message-*, thread-*, reaction-*, emoji-*, create-channel-modal, etc. per frontend hooks.\nhas_design: False\n============================================================\nMARATHON-9 DMs: get-or-create DM channel\nlabels: ['architect', 'backend']\ndeps: None\nPOST /api/dms {user_id} → 200 {channel_id}. Same channel id both directions and on repeated calls. Channel is_dm=true.\nhas_design: False\ncreated_at: 2026-08-22T22:16:35.53148094Z\ncreated_by: marathon-harness\ndescription: Build a self-contained Slack-like team chat at /app. Verifier runs /app/start.sh (foreground) which must keep serving while alive.\n\nExpose HTTP nodes on 127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002, IRC on :6667, browser\nhas_design: False\nid: MARATHON-1\nissue_type: epic\nowner: marathon-harness\npriority: 2\nstatus: open\ntitle: Huddle: Slack-like team chat cluster\nupdated_at: 2026-08-22T22:16:35.53148094Z\n","stderr":"","executionTime":266,"interleavedOutput":"============================================================\nMARATHON-10 Files: upload, metadata, download, attach\nlabels: ['architect', 'backend']\ndeps: [{'issue_id': 'MARATHON-10', 'depends_on_id': 'MARATHON-8', 'type': 'blocks', 'title': 'Messages, threads, reactions REST API', 'status': 'in_progress', 'issue_type': 'task', 'created_at': '2026-08-22T22:17:47.139019113Z', 'created_by': 'marathon-harness'}]\nPOST /api/files multipart file part → 201 {file:FileObj}; >10MiB → 413. GET /api/files/{id}; GET download with Content-Type and Content-Disposition. Attaching via file_ids on message create requires