":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":265,"content":"        json={\"join_mode\": \"closed\"},","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":277,"content":"        json={\"join_mode\": None},","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-233543-backend-dev-1--5fd5e7e5/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":64,"content":"GET /api/workspaces/{slug}/members → {members:[{user_id,role,...}]}. PATCH workspace {name,join_mode} admin/owner. PATCH members/{user_id} {role} with owner/admin/member/guest rules: admins cannot modify another admin or owner (403); setting role to owner via PATCH → 400; current owner's role via PATCH → 403. POST transfer_ownership {new_owner_id} owner-only; target must be admin else 400; previous owner becomes admin.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":71,"content":"This task completes workspace tenancy beyond create/list/detail (MARATHON-5): authenticated **members** can list workspace membership; **admins/owners** can PATCH `name` / `join_mode`; **admins/owners** can change other members’ roles under a strict hierarchy; and the **owner** alone can transfer ownership to an existing **admin** (previous owner becomes admin). It locks `MemberObj`, the four REST seams SPA settings (MARATHON-18) and channel/invitation authz (MARATHON-7/12) depend on, and keeps `workspaces.owner_id` synchronized with `workspace_members.role='owner'`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":91,"content":"- Schema already has `workspace_members.role` CHECK and `join_mode`; inventing a third ownership table would diverge from MARATHON-5.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":119,"content":"From **MARATHON-5**: `WorkspaceObj` exact keys; `validate_name` / slug rules; membership gate → 404; `join_mode` ∈ {`open`,`invite_only`}; roles ∈ {`owner`,`admin`,`member`,`guest`}; `forbidden` reserved for role rules.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":129,"content":"Design complete for workspace members/roles/transfer. No new migration (reuse v2). Contracts: GET members → MemberObj{user_id,role,username,display_name}; PATCH /{slug} name/join_mode admin|owner; PATCH members/{id} role with matrix (admin cannot touch admin/owner; role=owner→400; owner target→403); POST transfer_ownership owner→admin only, previous owner→admin. Non-members→404; privilege→403. Handed to review; implementer should keep backend label.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/frontend-dev-1/tests/test_workspaces.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":74,"content":"        json={\"slug\": \"acme\", \"name\": \"Acme Corp\", \"join_mode\": \"invite_only\", \"x\": 1},","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":85,"content":"    assert workspace[\"join_mode\"] == \"open\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/frontend-dev-1/server/workspaces/store.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":22,"content":"    \"join_mode\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":50,"content":"        \"join_mode\": get(\"join_mode\"),","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":73,"content":"                id, slug, name, owner_id, join_mode, created_at, updated_at","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":96,"content":"        \"join_mode\": \"open\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/frontend-dev-1/server/db.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":109,"content":"            join_mode TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'open'","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":110,"content":"                CHECK (join_mode IN ('open', 'invite_only')),","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-231530-app-architect-1--75625568/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":67,"content":"GET /api/workspaces/{slug}/members → {members:[{user_id,role,...}]}. PATCH workspace {name,join_mode} admin/owner. PATCH members/{user_id} {role} with owner/admin/member/guest rules: admins cannot modify another admin or owner (403); setting role to owner via PATCH → 400; current owner's role via PATCH → 403. POST transfer_ownership {new_owner_id} owner-only; target must be admin else 400; previous owner becomes admin.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/app-architect-1/tests/test_workspaces.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":74,"content":"        json={\"slug\": \"acme\", \"name\": \"Acme Corp\", \"join_mode\": \"invite_only\", \"x\": 1},","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":85,"content":"    assert workspace[\"join_mode\"] == \"open\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../worktrees/app/backend-dev-1/tests/test_workspaces.py","matches":[{"lineNumber":74,"content":"        json={\"slug\": \"acme\", \"name\": \"Acme Corp\", \"join_mode\": \"invite_only\", \"x\": 1},","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":85,"content":"    assert workspace[\"join_mode\"] == \"open\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-230008-backend-dev-1--cfebd2ac/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":64,"content":"WorkspaceObj {id, slug, name, owner_id, join_mode} with join_mode open|invite_only default open. POST /api/workspaces {slug,name} → 201 {workspace, general_channel}; slug kebab ^[a-z0-9-]{2,32}$; duplicate slug 409; creator is owner; auto-create #general. GET /api/workspaces → member/owned list. GET /api/workspaces/{slug} → {workspace, channels, read_state}; omit private channels caller is not in; ?include_archived=1 supported.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":71,"content":"This task adds the workspace tenancy root for Huddle: authenticated callers can create a workspace (unique kebab `slug`, display `name`, creator as `owner`, default `join_mode=open`), which atomically provisions the public `#general` channel and membership rows; list workspaces they own or belong to; and load a workspace by slug with the visible channel list plus embedded `read_state`. It locks `WorkspaceObj`, the initial `ChannelObj` shape used by later channel APIs, the SQLite schema for workspaces/members/channels, and the REST contracts the SPA shell (MARATHON-16) and members/channels tasks (MARATHON-6/7) consume.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../../../sessions/20260822-225358-app-architect-1--52da21f4/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":67,"content":"WorkspaceObj {id, slug, name, owner_id, join_mode} with join_mode open|invite_only default open. POST /api/workspaces {slug,name} → 201 {workspace, general_channel}; slug kebab ^[a-z0-9-]{2,32}$; duplicate slug 409; creator is owner; auto-create #general. GET /api/workspaces → member/owned list. GET /api/workspaces/{slug} → {workspace, channels, read_state}; omit private channels caller is not in; ?include_archived=1 supported.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":74,"content":"This task adds the workspace tenancy root for Huddle: authenticated callers can create a workspace (unique kebab `slug`, display `name`, creator as `owner`, default `join_mode=open`), which atomically provisions the public `#general` channel and membership rows; list workspaces they own or belong to; and load a workspace by slug with the visible channel list plus embedded `read_state`. It locks `WorkspaceObj`, the initial `ChannelObj` shape used by later channel APIs, the SQLite schema for workspaces/members/channels, and the REST contracts the SPA shell (MARATHON-16) and members/channels tasks (MARATHON-6/7) consume.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":108,"content":"| Include `join_mode` in POST body | Task body is `{slug,name}` only; `join_mode` changes are MARATHON-6 PATCH |","contentTruncated":false