| |\n| `invited_user_id` | TEXT NULL | FK users |\n| `invited_username` | TEXT NULL | snapshot at create |\n| `revoked_at` | TEXT NULL | null = not revoked |\n\nIndex: `workspace_invitations(workspace_id)`; unique on `code`.\n\n**No changes** to `workspaces.join_mode` CHECK or `workspace_members` schema.\n\n**Reverse v4:** DROP the three tables (local verification only), matching M2/M3 reverse style.\n\n## Files to Create / Files to Modify\n\n### Create\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `server/groups/__init__.py` | Package marker |\n| `server/groups/store.py` | Handle/name validation; CRUD; `row_to_group_obj`; membership replace |\n| `server/groups/routes.py` | GET/POST list-create; PATCH/DELETE by handle under `/api/workspaces/{slug}/groups` |\n| `server/invitations/__init__.py` | Package marker |\n| `server/invitations/store.py` | Create/list active/get-by-code/revoke/accept transaction helpers; code generation |\n| `server/invitations/routes.py` | Workspace POST/GET invitations; `POST/DELETE /api/invitations/{code}` (+ `/accept`) |\n| `tests/test_groups.py` | Group CRUD, authz, validation, conflict, guest 403 |\n| `tests/test_invitations.py` | Create defaults, targeted 403, 404 matrix, accept membership + general, revoke, invite_only still 403 on join without accept |\n\n### Modify\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `server/db.py` | `_migrate_v4` / `_reverse_v4`; register version **4** in `MIGRATIONS` / reverse map |\n| `server/workspaces/store.py` | Add `add_workspace_member(...)` helper if not present after M7 |\n| `server/channels/store.py` | Tiny helper `ensure_channel_member(channel_id, user_id)` for `#general` on accept (or inline in invitations store via SQL); **do not** invent channel CRUD |\n| `server/app.py` | `include_router` for groups + invitations routers |\n| `server/workspaces/routes.py` | Only if M7 join already exists here: ensure invite_only gate unchanged and open-join uses shared member helper. **Do not** re-implement full M7. |\n\n### Do not touch\n\n| File | Reason |\n|------|--------|\n| `static/**` | MARATHON-18 owns invitation/settings UI |\n| `server/auth/**`, `server/users/**` | Consume username lookup only |\n| Existing workspace/member tests | Keep green; add new test modules |\n| Message/search/mention expansion | MARATHON-8/11 |\n| Private channel add-member API | Optional follow-up; not in this task text |\n\n## Sequencing and Cross-Task Seams\n\n### Build order\n\n1. `db.py` v4 migration (+ reverse).\n2. `workspaces_store.add_workspace_member` + general channel member ensure.\n3. Groups store + routes + tests.","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":488,"fileSize":23695,"path":"/tmp/MARATHON-12.design.md","readRange":{"startLine":280,"endLine":379},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-5d406ddb-8b2e-4945-808a-d9048aa5ba02-49\nfc_e93a6d23-e11c-9de7-bdbd-4a70a149aa7d_3","startedAtMs":"1787445092998","completedAtMs":"1787445093554"},"model_call_id":"9f6c9f7b-0f6e-481b-af84-0b50164c6a84-15-r1v6","session_id":"83d80305-f80e-4005-a214-b95749113409","timestamp_ms":1787445093597}
