alues**. They must be present in the DOM when the corresponding UI state is visible (not merely in JS strings). Prefer exactly these strings — no prefixes.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":61,"content":"| `data-testid` | When visible | Role |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":77,"content":"| `channel-list` | Authenticated with current workspace | Container for non-DM channels (may be empty of children until channels load / MARATHON-17) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":82,"content":"| `data-testid` | Element |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":90,"content":"| `data-testid` | Element |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":99,"content":"| `data-testid` | Behavior in this task |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":101,"content":"| `message-pane` | Always present when shell is shown; may show placeholder copy (“Select a channel” / empty). **No** message composer required here. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":102,"content":"| `thread-panel` | Present in DOM; **`hidden` / not displayed** by default (`display:none` or equivalent). MARATHON-17 opens it. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":150,"content":"| **Client** | All calls send bearer. **List** after auth: if `workspaces.length === 0`, show empty state (`empty-state-create-workspace` + create + join forms). If non-empty: prefer `huddle.workspaceSlug` if it appears in the list; else first list item (sorted as server returns). **Create**: `POST` `{slug,name}`; on **201** persist slug, load detail, enter shell. On **400/409** show `workspace-create-error`. **Detail**: populate `workspace-header`, split `channels` into `channel-list` (`is_dm === false`) and `dms-list` (`is_dm === true`); ignore `read_state` badges in this task (optional no-op). On detail **404**: clear invalid stored slug, fall back to list/empty. On any **401**: logout locally. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":153,"content":"**Channel row markup (minimal, for MARATHON-17):** each channel entry **should** expose `data-channel-id=\"{id}\"` and `data-channel-name=\"{name}\"` when listed. Display name may show `#` prefix for non-DM; stored `name` remains without `#`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":209,"content":"| `static/index.html` | SPA shell markup: auth modal, empty/onboarding, three-pane layout; all required `data-testid`s; `<title>Huddle</title>`; script `type=\"module\"` entry. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":224,"content":"| `tests/test_health.py` | Keep asserting `GET /` 200 HTML + `\"Huddle\"` in body (still true). Optionally assert a stable selector string appears in HTML (e.g. `data-testid=\"auth-form\"`) — recommended, not mandatory if covered by a new SPA test file. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":225,"content":"| `tests/test_spa_shell.py` (create) | TestClient: `/` contains required testids; `/static/...` 200; optional auth flow via API + HTML presence (no browser required for unit). |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":249,"content":"- MARATHON-17/18 **must** land after this shell (they depend on this task).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":255,"content":"| `data-testid` shell + auth set above | QA / CUA; MARATHON-17/18 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":257,"content":"| Hash route `#/w/{slug}` + in-memory workspace/channel selection hooks | MARATHON-17 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":258,"content":"| Hidden `thread-panel` slot | MARATHON-17 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":259,"content":"| `channel-list` / `dms-list` containers + `data-channel-id` | MARATHON-17 |","contentTruncated":false,"isCon