{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-ebbcaced-1e41-436e-b0e2-13300db972e6-14\nfc_8383fc3e-a949-961c-9b9b-f1a0acdf0b32_1","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"Interface Contract|MessageObj|POST /api/channels|reactions|threads|reply_count|edited","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-8.md","caseInsensitive":false,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-ebbcaced-1e41-436e-b0e2-13300db972e6-14\nfc_8383fc3e-a949-961c-9b9b-f1a0acdf0b32_1","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"Interface Contract|MessageObj|POST /api/channels|reactions|threads|reply_count|edited","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-8.md","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"../../../../../tmp/designs/MARATHON-8.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":1,"content":"# MARATHON-8 — Messages, threads, reactions REST API","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":5,"content":"This task completes the core chat write/read path for Huddle on top of MARATHON-7 channels and the minimal `messages` / pin embed already shipped: authenticated channel members can post top-level messages and one-level thread replies, list channel history (newest-first, cursor pagination) and thread replies (oldest-first), edit their own messages, soft-delete as author or workspace owner, and add/remove emoji reactions. It locks the REST `MessageObj` / `ReactionObj` contracts the SPA (MARATHON-17) and downstream search/WS tasks consume, extends schema with reaction (and optional attachment join) tables while **preserving** the v3 `messages` table and pin routes, and leaves slash-command interception, full mention forms, file upload ownership, and dense `seq` fan-out to their owning tasks.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":13,"content":"| Persistence | Shared SQLite SoT; **migration version 4** additive: `message_reactions`, optional `message_files`, optional `messages.blocks_json`; **do not** drop/recreate v3 `messages` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":14,"content":"| Route layout | Channel-scoped on `server/channels/routes.py`: `POST`/`GET /api/channels/{id}/messages`. Message-scoped on existing `server/messages/routes.py`: `PATCH`/`DELETE /{id}`, `GET /{parent_id}/replies`, `POST`/`DELETE .../reactions`, keep existing pin routes |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":16,"content":"| `MessageObj` | **Same key set as MARATHON-7** (`MESSAGE_OBJ_KEYS`); enrich `reply_count`, `files`, `reactions`, `mentions` for real data; **no `seq`** on REST objects (product: seq lives on WS frames — MARATHON-13) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":23,"content":"| `file_ids` / `blocks` | Accept on POST for product shape; `blocks` persisted as JSON text (not exposed on `MessageObj` keys); `file_ids` validated against files when present — **non-empty `file_ids` → 400** until MARATHON-10 provides attachable `files` rows (seam documented) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":32,"content":"- Product contract (epic planning) is explicit on paths, envelopes (`201 {message}`, `{replies}`, `{reactions}`, `{deleted:true}`), reaction shape, and delete/edit conflict semantics; inventing alternates breaks graders and MARATHON-17.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":44,"content":"| Nested threads (reply-to-reply) | Product is parent/replies one level; reject deep `parent_id` with 400 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":45,"content":"| Include `seq` on `MessageObj` | Product: seq on WS frames only |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":62,"content":"From **MARATHON-7**: `ChannelObj`; `assert_channel_writable` → **423** `archived`; minimal `MessageObj` key set; pin routes stay; private vs public visibility matrix for pins/messages reads; channel-member required for pin/message **writes**.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":64,"content":"## Interface Contracts","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":68,"content":"#### `MessageObj` (normative keys — do not omit; do not add `seq` / `blocks` / `deleted_at` to JSON)","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":78,"content":"  \"reply_count\": 0,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":80,"content":"  \"edited_at\": null,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":82,"content":"  \"reactions\": [],","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":91,"content":"| `reply_count` | Count of **non-deleted** children with `parent_id = this.id` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":92,"content":"| `edited_at` | `null` until first successful PATCH; then UTC Z timestamp |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":94,"content":"| `reactions` | `ReactionObj[]` aggregated (below) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":135,"content":"### Seam: Client ↔ `POST /api/channels/{channel_id}/messages`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":139,"content":"| **Client (SPA M17)** | Bearer; body `{body, parent_id?, file_ids?, blocks?}`; disable composer while in flight; on 201 append message / bump thread `reply_count`; on 400 show empty-message validation; on 423 show archived lock |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":158,"content":"- `blocks` optional; if present must be a **JSON array** (elements unchecked beyond JSON); persist as `blocks_json`; **not** included in `MessageObj` response keys.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":161,"content":"**Response:** `201 { \"message\": MessageObj }`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":163,"content":"**Effects:** Insert row (`edited_at=null`, `deleted_at=null`); compute `mentions`; if `parent_id` set, child’s presence increases parent `reply_count` on subsequent reads; call `publish_message_created` after commit (no-op OK).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":177,"content":"**Response:** `200 { \"messages\": [MessageObj, ...] }`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":179,"content":"Each element fully enriched (`author`, `reply_count`, `reactions`, `mentions`, `files`).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":185,"content":"| **Client** | Body `{body}`; show edited indicator from `edited_at`; on 409 treat as deleted |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":186,"content":"| **Server** | Author-only; not deleted; writable channel; set `body`, `edited_at=now`, re-resolve `mentions` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":196,"content":"- **200** `{ \"message\": MessageObj }`; call `publish_message_updated` after commit.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":218,"content":"| **Client (thread panel)** | Bearer; render oldest-first; bump parent reply badge from parent `reply_count` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":221,"content":"**Response:** `200 { \"replies\": [MessageObj, ...] }`  ","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":228,"content":"### Seam: Client ↔ reactions","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":230,"content":"#### `POST /api/messages/{message_id}/reactions` body `{ \"emoji\": \"👍\" }` → `200 { \"reactions\": [ReactionObj, ...] }`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":236,"content":"- Return **full** aggregated `reactions` for that message (not only the one emoji).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":239,"content":"#### `DELETE /api/messages/{message_id}/reactions/{emoji}` → `200 { \"reactions\": [...] }`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":263,"content":"`messages(id, channel_id, author_id, body, parent_id, created_at, edited_at, deleted_at)` — already created in MARATHON-7 v3 + `idx_messages_channel_id`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":271,"content":"| `blocks_json` | TEXT | NULL | JSON array text; omit from `MessageObj` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":280,"content":"#### `message_reactions`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":314,"content":"2. `reply_count` never includes deleted children.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":317,"content":"5. Pin routes continue to work; `get_message` / `row_to_message_obj` enrich reactions/mentions/files/reply_count for pin embeds too.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":318,"content":"6. REST `MessageObj` never carries `seq`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":326,"content":"| `tests/test_messages.py` | Contract tests: post/list/pagination/edit/delete/replies/reactions/authz/423/409/empty body/parent rules/idempotent delete & reactions; cluster read-after-write on second node |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":333,"content":"| `server/messages/store.py` | Create/list/get with enrichment; soft delete; reply list; reaction insert/delete/aggregate; mention resolve helper; `row_to_message_obj` fills real `reply_count`/`reactions`/`mentions`/`files` (files empty until M10); keep `MESSAGE_OBJ_KEYS` unchanged |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":334,"content":"| `server/messages/routes.py` | Add PATCH, DELETE, GET replies, POST/DELETE reactions; keep pin routes; factor `_require_pin_access` into shared `_require_message_channel_access(read|write)` used by pins + CRUD + reactions |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":336,"content":"| `server/events.py` | No-op `publish_message_created/updated/deleted`, `publish_reaction_changed` with docstring payloads for M13 (`type`, `channel_id`, message/reactions fields — **seq assigned by M13**) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":338,"content":"| `tests/test_pins.py` | Only if enrichment changes assertions (prefer keep using `MESSAGE_OBJ_KEYS`; update empty `reactions` expectations only if pins now return aggregates — still `[]` without reaction rows) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":357,"content":"2. `messages/store.py` enrichment + CRUD + reactions + mentions.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":359,"content":"4. Message PATCH/DELETE/replies/reactions routes.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":372,"content":"| `MessageObj` + POST/GET channel messages + PATCH/DELETE | MARATHON-17 SPA; MARATHON-11 search/slash (reads body); MARATHON-13 event payloads |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":374,"content":"| `{reactions}` aggregate + POST/DELETE idempotent | MARATHON-17 emoji picker |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":379,"content":"| Pin embed still `MessageObj` | Existing pin UI / tests |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":399,"content":"| `GET/POST /api/channels/{id}/read` | read_state | MARATHON-11 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":411,"content":"| `server/messages/store.py` — thin `MessageObj` / get | **In scope** — enrich + CRUD |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":412,"content":"| `server/messages/routes.py` — pin only | **In scope** — add CRUD/reactions; keep pins |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":457,"content":"| `blocks: []` | Persist; MessageObj unchanged keys |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":459,"content":"| Pin list after message soft-delete | Return pin entry with tombstone `MessageObj`: `body=\"\"`, `files=[]`, `reactions=[]`, `mentions=[]`, `reply_count` as computed; **or** skip pin — **prefer tombstone** so pin list length stable |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":465,"content":"1. `POST /api/channels/{id}/messages` `{body:\"hi\"}` as channel member → **201** `{message}` with exact `MessageObj` keys; `edited_at=null`; `parent_id=null`; `reply_count=0`; `reactions=[]`; `files=[]`; `mentions` reflects `@username` rules.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":468,"content":"4. Reply via `parent_id` → **201**; parent’s subsequent `reply_count` is 1; `GET /api/messages/{parent}/replies` → **200** `{replies:[…]}` oldest-first.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":469,"content":"5. `PATCH /api/messages/{id}` as author → **200**; `edited_at` set; non-author → **403**; after DELETE → PATCH **409**.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":471,"content":"7. `POST /api/messages/{id}/reactions` `{emoji}` → **200** `{reactions:[{emoji,count,user_ids}]}` idempotent per `(user,emoji)`; `DELETE .../reactions/{emoji}` → **200** `{reactions}` idempotent.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":475,"content":"11. Existing pin tests remain green; pin embed still exposes full `MessageObj` keys.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":476,"content":"12. **Negative:** must **not** put `seq` on `MessageObj`; must **not** interpret slash commands; must **not** drop/recreate `messages` table; must **not** allow reply-to-reply; must **not** return deleted messages in channel history; must **not** use `{messages}` as the replies envelope key.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":483,"content":"- Thread create + replies ordering + `reply_count`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":484,"content":"- Edit sets `edited_at`; edit deleted → 409; delete idempotent; owner delete.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":63,"totalMatchedLines":63,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-ebbcaced-1e41-436e-b0e2-13300db972e6-14\nfc_8383fc3e-a949-961c-9b9b-f1a0acdf0b32_1","startedAtMs":"1787447701864","completedAtMs":"1787447702353"},"model_call_id":"03dd848d-d7bd-4877-bfbf-ce6458bc28c6-5-fktq","session_id":"8d1f97e9-e376-440d-a791-e2992491ec56","timestamp_ms":1787447702377}
