{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-ebbcaced-1e41-436e-b0e2-13300db972e6-15\nfc_8383fc3e-a949-961c-9b9b-f1a0acdf0b32_2","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"Interface Contract|ChannelObj|POST /api/workspaces|duplicate|name|topic","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-7.md","caseInsensitive":false,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-ebbcaced-1e41-436e-b0e2-13300db972e6-15\nfc_8383fc3e-a949-961c-9b9b-f1a0acdf0b32_2","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"Interface Contract|ChannelObj|POST /api/workspaces|duplicate|name|topic","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-7.md","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"../../../../../tmp/designs/MARATHON-7.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":1,"content":"# MARATHON-7 — Channels: create, join, leave, topic, archive, pins","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":5,"content":"This task completes channel lifecycle for Huddle on top of the workspace tenancy shipped in MARATHON-5/6: authenticated callers can create public/private channels under a workspace slug, join and leave channels (with open-workspace auto-onboard and invite_only/guest/private gates), list channel members as `UserObj`, patch topic, archive/unarchive (owner-only), and pin/unpin messages. It also implements the SPA-locked workspace join seam (`POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join`) that MARATHON-16 already calls. It locks the `/api/channels/*` and pin REST contracts, introduces migration **v3** (`messages` minimal + `channel_pins`), and exports a shared **archived-write guard** (`423`) that MARATHON-8/11 must reuse.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":16,"content":"| `ChannelObj` | **Unchanged** key set from MARATHON-5 (`CHANNEL_OBJ_KEYS`); this task owns create/mutate behavior |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":20,"content":"| Archived writes | Shared helper `assert_channel_writable` → **423** `archived`; used by topic PATCH + pin mutate now; documented for M8 message/reaction writes |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":53,"content":"From **MARATHON-5**: `ChannelObj` exact keys; `WorkspaceObj`; workspace slug resolution; non-member workspace routes → **404** (do not leak); `include_archived` semantics unchanged; `#general` name without `#`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":57,"content":"From **MARATHON-16**: `POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join` body `{}`; **200** `{workspace}` (+ optional `channels`/`read_state`); open → member; invite_only → 403; unknown → 404; idempotent if already member.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":59,"content":"## Interface Contracts","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":63,"content":"#### `ChannelObj` (unchanged)","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":69,"content":"  \"name\": \"eng\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":72,"content":"  \"topic\": \"\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":77,"content":"Exact keys: `id`, `workspace_id`, `name`, `is_private`, `is_dm`, `topic`, `is_archived`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":81,"content":"Exact keys: `id`, `username`, `display_name`, `timezone`, `avatar_url`, `status_text`, `status_emoji`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":128,"content":"| `validation_error` | 400 | Bad name/topic; topic > 250; null where disallowed |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":132,"content":"| `conflict` | 409 | Duplicate channel name in workspace |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":133,"content":"| `archived` | 423 | Mutating write against `is_archived=1` channel (topic, pin, and future message writes) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":146,"content":"| `PATCH` topic | channel member **or** workspace owner | same | same | same if channel member | — | — |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":151,"content":"### Seam: Client ↔ `POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":163,"content":"  \"channels\": [ /* visible ChannelObj[] */ ],","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":170,"content":"### Seam: Client ↔ `POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/channels`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":174,"content":"| **Client (SPA M17)** | Bearer; body `{name, is_private?, topic?}`; show create-channel modal errors; on 201 append channel to sidebar (`data-channel-id` / `data-channel-name`); on 409 show duplicate-name validation; on 403 show permission error |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":180,"content":"{ \"name\": \"eng\", \"is_private\": false, \"topic\": \"optional\" }","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":183,"content":"- `name` required; kebab regex **`^[a-z0-9-]{2,32}$`** (same family as workspace slug; strip not applied — must already match).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":185,"content":"- `topic` optional, default `\"\"`; if present must be string length ≤ 250 code points; longer → 400.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":186,"content":"- Unknown fields ignored. Do **not** accept `description` as topic alias (product: no description→topic).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":189,"content":"**Response 201:** `{ \"channel\": { /* ChannelObj */ } }`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":191,"content":"**Errors:** 401; 404 non-member/unknown slug; 403 guest or member+private; 400 validation; 409 duplicate name (`conflict`, e.g. `\"channel name already taken\"`); IntegrityError race → same 409.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":200,"content":"| **Server** | Resolve channel by id; apply join rules below; return **200** (envelope: prefer `{ \"channel\": ChannelObj }` for consistency with leave/archive; if returning bare 200 with empty body is undesired — **always return `{channel}`**) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":244,"content":"- Private: caller must be **channel member** else **403** (align with pin-list private rule). Workspace owner who is not a channel member still gets **403** unless also a channel member (owner can PATCH topic without membership, but members list follows private pin rule). *Clarification:* workspace **owner** may list members of private channels in their workspace even without channel membership (settings UX); implementer **should** allow workspace owner OR channel member for private member list. Prefer: **channel member OR workspace owner**.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":246,"content":"**Ordering:** `username ASC` (case-insensitive), tie-break `id ASC`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":252,"content":"| **Client** | Body `{topic}`; disable topic submit; on 200 update `channel-topic` header; on 423 show archived error |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":253,"content":"| **Server** | Authz; validate topic; reject if archived; update; return `{channel}` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":255,"content":"**Request:** `{ \"topic\": \"Ship week\" }` — `topic` required when patching (only mutable field in this task). Omit/`exclude_unset`: empty `{}` → 200 no-op if authorized. Explicit `null` → 400. Max **250** Unicode code points.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":307,"content":"| In flight | Disable create/join/topic/archive/pin controls; keep prior lists |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":310,"content":"| 409 | Duplicate channel name inline validation |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":360,"content":"1. `UNIQUE(workspace_id, name)` on channels enforced; API maps violations to 409.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":376,"content":"| `tests/test_channels.py` | Contract tests: create/join/leave/topic/archive/roles/423/workspace-join |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":384,"content":"| `server/channels/store.py` | `validate_channel_name`, `validate_topic`, `create_channel`, `get_channel`, `add_member`, `remove_member`, `list_members_as_users`, `set_archived`, `update_topic`, `assert_channel_writable`, pin list queries; keep existing list/general helpers |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":402,"content":"| Slash `/archive` `/topic` | MARATHON-11 (will call same store helpers) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":424,"content":"| `POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/channels` + `ChannelObj` create | MARATHON-17 SPA create modal |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":426,"content":"| `POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join` | MARATHON-16 shell (already calling) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":427,"content":"| leave / members / PATCH topic / archive | MARATHON-18 settings; MARATHON-11 slash cmds |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":434,"content":"- MARATHON-5/6 closed: schema v2, roles, ChannelObj, join_mode.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":446,"content":"- Slash command side effects → MARATHON-11 (reuse archive/topic store).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":460,"content":"| Slash `/topic` `/archive` | message body commands | MARATHON-11 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":470,"content":"| `server/channels/store.py` — ChannelObj, general, list, read_state | **In scope** — extend |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":486,"content":"| Create channel name `General` / `eng_ops` / `e` / empty | **400** |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":487,"content":"| Create name `general` when `#general` exists | **409** |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":488,"content":"| Concurrent duplicate name | IntegrityError → **409** (no 500) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":504,"content":"| PATCH topic on archived | **423** `archived` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":519,"content":"1. `POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/channels` with valid `{name}` as member → **201** `{channel}` with `ChannelObj` keys; `topic` default `\"\"`; `is_dm=false`; creator in `channel_members`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":520,"content":"2. Duplicate channel name in workspace → **409** `conflict`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":521,"content":"3. Invalid kebab name or topic > 250 → **400** `validation_error`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":523,"content":"5. `POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join` on open as non-member → **200** and subsequent workspace detail succeeds; invite_only → **403**; unknown slug → **404**; already member → **200** idempotent.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":527,"content":"9. `PATCH /api/channels/{id}` `{topic}` as channel member or workspace owner → **200** `{channel}`; archived → **423** `archived`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":532,"content":"14. **Negative:** must **not** accept `description` as topic; must **not** allow guest public join; must **not** implement message CRUD routes; must **not** store channel SoT in Redis; must **not** change `ChannelObj` key set; must **not** use 404 for archived writes.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":556,"content":"# register A and B; A creates workspace; B joins via POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":557,"content":"# A creates #eng; B joins channel; A archives; B PATCH topic → 423","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":57,"totalMatchedLines":57,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-ebbcaced-1e41-436e-b0e2-13300db972e6-15\nfc_8383fc3e-a949-961c-9b9b-f1a0acdf0b32_2","startedAtMs":"1787447702299","completedAtMs":"1787447702842"},"model_call_id":"03dd848d-d7bd-4877-bfbf-ce6458bc28c6-5-fktq","session_id":"8d1f97e9-e376-440d-a791-e2992491ec56","timestamp_ms":1787447702867}
