ane layout; all required `data-testid`s; `<title>Huddle</title>`; script `type=\"module\"` entry. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":214,"content":"| `static/js/shell.js` | Empty state, create/join forms, workspace header, channel/dms lists, logout, hash routing. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":224,"content":"| `tests/test_health.py` | Keep asserting `GET /` 200 HTML + `\"Huddle\"` in body (still true). Optionally assert a stable selector string appears in HTML (e.g. `data-testid=\"auth-form\"`) — recommended, not mandatory if covered by a new SPA test file. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":249,"content":"- MARATHON-17/18 **must** land after this shell (they depend on this task).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":255,"content":"| `data-testid` shell + auth set above | QA / CUA; MARATHON-17/18 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":257,"content":"| Hash route `#/w/{slug}` + in-memory workspace/channel selection hooks | MARATHON-17 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":258,"content":"| Hidden `thread-panel` slot | MARATHON-17 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":259,"content":"| `channel-list` / `dms-list` containers + `data-channel-id` | MARATHON-17 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":264,"content":"- **MARATHON-17** — messages, threads, reactions, channel create/switch UI inside this shell.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":272,"content":"| Message composer, edit/delete, reactions, emoji picker | MARATHON-17 description; no message routes yet (MARATHON-8 open) | Dependent SPA task |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":273,"content":"| Opening/populating `thread-panel` with replies | MARATHON-17 | Shell only mounts hidden slot |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":283,"content":"Neighborhood scan accounted for: `HTMLResponse` stub in `server/app.py`; `tests/test_health.py` + `tests/test_cluster_boot.py` `GET /` HTML assertions (remain valid if brand “Huddle” + HTML document preserved); no existing `static/` tree; no `localStorage` / `data-testid` hits in-repo yet.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":317,"content":"7. Creating a workspace via the form calls `POST /api/workspaces` and then shows shell with `workspace-header`, `channel-list`, `dms-list`, `current-user`, `logout-btn`, `message-pane`, and hidden `thread-panel`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":332,"content":"- Add `tests/test_spa_shell.py` (TestClient): document contains critical `data-testid`s; `/static/js/app.js` (or chosen entry) returns 200; optional flow register via API then assert token key documented (storage is browser-only — HTML/API integration is enough at unit layer).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":342,"content":"7. Toggle auth register/login; confirm selectors exist for Playwright (`document.querySelector('[data-testid=\"auth-form\"]')` etc.).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":346,"content":"Full message/thread/reaction flows (MARATHON-17); settings/invitations (MARATHON-18); successful open-workspace join (blocked on MARATHON-7 server).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":29,"totalMatchedLines":29,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-78225085-3d28-418e-b6f7-3d9a1ea01878-45\nfc_446ae43f-337e-9205-9640-31e4fc47203e_2","startedAtMs":"1787447805606","completedAtMs":"1787447806320"},"model_call_id":"03dd848d-d7bd-4877-bfbf-ce6458bc28c6-14-uwdb","session_id":"8d1f97e9-e376-440d-a791-e2992491ec56","timestamp_ms":1787447806344}
