{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-78225085-3d28-418e-b6f7-3d9a1ea01878-46\nfc_446ae43f-337e-9205-9640-31e4fc47203e_3","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"Interface|Client \\(SPA|POST /api|GET /api|ReactionObj|MessageObj|edited_at|parent_id|reply_count","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-8.md","caseInsensitive":false,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-78225085-3d28-418e-b6f7-3d9a1ea01878-46\nfc_446ae43f-337e-9205-9640-31e4fc47203e_3","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"Interface|Client \\(SPA|POST /api|GET /api|ReactionObj|MessageObj|edited_at|parent_id|reply_count","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-8.md","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"../../../../../tmp/designs/MARATHON-8.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":5,"content":"This task completes the core chat write/read path for Huddle on top of MARATHON-7 channels and the minimal `messages` / pin embed already shipped: authenticated channel members can post top-level messages and one-level thread replies, list channel history (newest-first, cursor pagination) and thread replies (oldest-first), edit their own messages, soft-delete as author or workspace owner, and add/remove emoji reactions. It locks the REST `MessageObj` / `ReactionObj` contracts the SPA (MARATHON-17) and downstream search/WS tasks consume, extends schema with reaction (and optional attachment join) tables while **preserving** the v3 `messages` table and pin routes, and leaves slash-command interception, full mention forms, file upload ownership, and dense `seq` fan-out to their owning tasks.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":14,"content":"| Route layout | Channel-scoped on `server/channels/routes.py`: `POST`/`GET /api/channels/{id}/messages`. Message-scoped on existing `server/messages/routes.py`: `PATCH`/`DELETE /{id}`, `GET /{parent_id}/replies`, `POST`/`DELETE .../reactions`, keep existing pin routes |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":16,"content":"| `MessageObj` | **Same key set as MARATHON-7** (`MESSAGE_OBJ_KEYS`); enrich `reply_count`, `files`, `reactions`, `mentions` for real data; **no `seq`** on REST objects (product: seq lives on WS frames — MARATHON-13) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":21,"content":"| Threads | Single level only: `parent_id` must reference a **top-level** (`parent_id IS NULL`), same-channel, non-deleted message |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":23,"content":"| `file_ids` / `blocks` | Accept on POST for product shape; `blocks` persisted as JSON text (not exposed on `MessageObj` keys); `file_ids` validated against files when present — **non-empty `file_ids` → 400** until MARATHON-10 provides attachable `files` rows (seam documented) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":41,"content":"| Put all routes under `/api/messages` only | Product: `POST/GET /api/channels/{id}/messages` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":44,"content":"| Nested threads (reply-to-reply) | Product is parent/replies one level; reject deep `parent_id` with 400 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":45,"content":"| Include `seq` on `MessageObj` | Product: seq on WS frames only |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":62,"content":"From **MARATHON-7**: `ChannelObj`; `assert_channel_writable` → **423** `archived`; minimal `MessageObj` key set; pin routes stay; private vs public visibility matrix for pins/messages reads; channel-member required for pin/message **writes**.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":64,"content":"## Interface Contracts","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":68,"content":"#### `MessageObj` (normative keys — do not omit; do not add `seq` / `blocks` / `deleted_at` to JSON)","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":77,"content":"  \"parent_id\": null,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":78,"content":"  \"reply_count\": 0,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":80,"content":"  \"edited_at\": null,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":91,"content":"| `reply_count` | Count of **non-deleted** children with `parent_id = this.id` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":92,"content":"| `edited_at` | `null` until first successful PATCH; then UTC Z timestamp |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":94,"content":"| `reactions` | `ReactionObj[]` aggregated (below) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":97,"content":"#### `ReactionObj`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":118,"content":"| `validation_error` | 400 | Empty/whitespace body; body too long; bad `limit`/`before`; bad `parent_id`; bad `emoji`; non-empty unsatisfiable `file_ids`; `blocks` not a list when present |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":129,"content":"**`require_channel_message_read(channel, user)`** — same rules as `GET /api/channels/{id}/pins` (public: workspace member; private/DM: channel member).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":135,"content":"### Seam: Client ↔ `POST /api/channels/{channel_id}/messages`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":139,"content":"| **Client (SPA M17)** | Bearer; body `{body, parent_id?, file_ids?, blocks?}`; disable composer while in flight; on 201 append message / bump thread `reply_count`; on 400 show empty-message validation; on 423 show archived lock |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":147,"content":"  \"parent_id\": null,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":156,"content":"- `parent_id` optional; if set: must exist, same `channel_id`, `deleted_at IS NULL`, and parent’s `parent_id IS NULL`; else **400**.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":158,"content":"- `blocks` optional; if present must be a **JSON array** (elements unchecked beyond JSON); persist as `blocks_json`; **not** included in `MessageObj` response keys.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":161,"content":"**Response:** `201 { \"message\": MessageObj }`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":163,"content":"**Effects:** Insert row (`edited_at=null`, `deleted_at=null`); compute `mentions`; if `parent_id` set, child’s presence increases parent `reply_count` on subsequent reads; call `publish_message_created` after commit (no-op OK).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":165,"content":"### Seam: Client ↔ `GET /api/channels/{channel_id}/messages?limit=&before=`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":170,"content":"| **Server** | Authz read; return **only top-level** (`parent_id IS NULL`) **non-deleted** messages; **newest-first** |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":177,"content":"**Response:** `200 { \"messages\": [MessageObj, ...] }`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":179,"content":"Each element fully enriched (`author`, `reply_count`, `reactions`, `mentions`, `files`).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":185,"content":"| **Client** | Body `{body}`; show edited indicator from `edited_at`; on 409 treat as deleted |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":186,"content":"| **Server** | Author-only; not deleted; writable channel; set `body`, `edited_at=now`, re-resolve `mentions` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":195,"content":"- `parent_id` / `file_ids` **not** patchable in this task (ignore if sent).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":196,"content":"- **200** `{ \"message\": MessageObj }`; call `publish_message_updated` after commit.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":214,"content":"### Seam: Client ↔ `GET /api/messages/{parent_id}/replies`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":218,"content":"| **Client (thread panel)** | Bearer; render oldest-first; bump parent reply badge from parent `reply_count` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":221,"content":"**Response:** `200 { \"replies\": [MessageObj, ...] }`  ","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":230,"content":"#### `POST /api/messages/{message_id}/reactions` body `{ \"emoji\": \"👍\" }` → `200 { \"reactions\": [ReactionObj, ...] }`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":263,"content":"`messages(id, channel_id, author_id, body, parent_id, created_at, edited_at, deleted_at)` — already created in MARATHON-7 v3 + `idx_messages_channel_id`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":271,"content":"| `blocks_json` | TEXT | NULL | JSON array text; omit from `MessageObj` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":278,"content":"- `idx_messages_parent_created` on `(parent_id, created_at ASC, id ASC)` for replies.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":314,"content":"2. `reply_count` never includes deleted children.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":316,"content":"4. `parent_id` either NULL or points to top-level message in same channel.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":317,"content":"5. Pin routes continue to work; `get_message` / `row_to_message_obj` enrich reactions/mentions/files/reply_count for pin embeds too.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":318,"content":"6. REST `MessageObj` never carries `seq`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":333,"content":"| `server/messages/store.py` | Create/list/get with enrichment; soft delete; reply list; reaction insert/delete/aggregate; mention resolve helper; `row_to_message_obj` fills real `reply_count`/`reactions`/`mentions`/`files` (files empty until M10); keep `MESSAGE_OBJ_KEYS` unchanged |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":372,"content":"| `MessageObj` + POST/GET channel messages + PATCH/DELETE | MARATHON-17 SPA; MARATHON-11 search/slash (reads body); MARATHON-13 event payloads |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":379,"content":"| Pin embed still `MessageObj` | Existing pin UI / tests |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":396,"content":"| `POST /api/files` multipart + download | future `server/files/*` | MARATHON-10 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":399,"content":"| `GET/POST /api/channels/{id}/read` | read_state | MARATHON-11 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":400,"content":"| `GET /api/search` | search | MARATHON-11 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":402,"content":"| `POST /api/dms` | DM channels | MARATHON-9 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":411,"content":"| `server/messages/store.py` — thin `MessageObj` / get | **In scope** — enrich + CRUD |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":432,"content":"| POST with `parent_id` pointing at a reply | **400** |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":433,"content":"| POST with `parent_id` in another channel | **400** |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":434,"content":"| POST with `parent_id` deleted | **400** |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":457,"content":"| `blocks: []` | Persist; MessageObj unchanged keys |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":459,"content":"| Pin list after message soft-delete | Return pin entry with tombstone `MessageObj`: `body=\"\"`, `files=[]`, `reactions=[]`, `mentions=[]`, `reply_count` as computed; **or** skip pin — **prefer tombstone** so pin list length stable |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":465,"content":"1. `POST /api/channels/{id}/messages` `{body:\"hi\"}` as channel member → **201** `{message}` with exact `MessageObj` keys; `edited_at=null`; `parent_id=null`; `reply_count=0`; `reactions=[]`; `files=[]`; `mentions` reflects `@username` rules.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":467,"content":"3. `GET /api/channels/{id}/messages` → **200** `{messages}` newest-first; only top-level non-deleted; supports `limit` + `before` cursor.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":468,"content":"4. Reply via `parent_id` → **201**; parent’s subsequent `reply_count` is 1; `GET /api/messages/{parent}/replies` → **200** `{replies:[…]}` oldest-first.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":469,"content":"5. `PATCH /api/messages/{id}` as author → **200**; `edited_at` set; non-author → **403**; after DELETE → PATCH **409**.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":471,"content":"7. `POST /api/messages/{id}/reactions` `{emoji}` → **200** `{reactions:[{emoji,count,user_ids}]}` idempotent per `(user,emoji)`; `DELETE .../reactions/{emoji}` → **200** `{reactions}` idempotent.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":475,"content":"11. Existing pin tests remain green; pin embed still exposes full `MessageObj` keys.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":476,"content":"12. **Negative:** must **not** put `seq` on `MessageObj`; must **not** interpret slash commands; must **not** drop/recreate `messages` table; must **not** allow reply-to-reply; must **not** return deleted messages in channel history; must **not** use `{messages}` as the replies envelope key.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":483,"content":"- Thread create + replies ordering + `reply_count`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":484,"content":"- Edit sets `edited_at`; edit deleted → 409; delete idempotent; owner delete.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":68,"totalMatchedLines":68,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-78225085-3d28-418e-b6f7-3d9a1ea01878-46\nfc_446ae43f-337e-9205-9640-31e4fc47203e_3","startedAtMs":"1787447806251","completedAtMs":"1787447806988"},"model_call_id":"03dd848d-d7bd-4877-bfbf-ce6458bc28c6-14-uwdb","session_id":"8d1f97e9-e376-440d-a791-e2992491ec56","timestamp_ms":1787447807014}
