{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-78225085-3d28-418e-b6f7-3d9a1ea01878-47\nfc_446ae43f-337e-9205-9640-31e4fc47203e_4","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"POST /api/workspaces/.*/channels|Client \\(SPA|create-channel|channel name|kebab","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-7.md","caseInsensitive":false,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-78225085-3d28-418e-b6f7-3d9a1ea01878-47\nfc_446ae43f-337e-9205-9640-31e4fc47203e_4","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"POST /api/workspaces/.*/channels|Client \\(SPA|create-channel|channel name|kebab","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-7.md","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"../../../../../tmp/designs/MARATHON-7.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":5,"content":"This task completes channel lifecycle for Huddle on top of the workspace tenancy shipped in MARATHON-5/6: authenticated callers can create public/private channels under a workspace slug, join and leave channels (with open-workspace auto-onboard and invite_only/guest/private gates), list channel members as `UserObj`, patch topic, archive/unarchive (owner-only), and pin/unpin messages. It also implements the SPA-locked workspace join seam (`POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/join`) that MARATHON-16 already calls. It locks the `/api/channels/*` and pin REST contracts, introduces migration **v3** (`messages` minimal + `channel_pins`), and exports a shared **archived-write guard** (`423`) that MARATHON-8/11 must reuse.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":132,"content":"| `conflict` | 409 | Duplicate channel name in workspace |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":155,"content":"| **Client (SPA M16)** | Bearer; body `{}`; disable submit; on 200 persist slug + enter shell (use returned `channels` if present else detail GET); on 4xx show `join-workspace-error` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":170,"cont