{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-4c7c91d3-c485-405f-b495-91b8d1ae3c26-68\nfc_fdef9bd9-125b-9141-a1a2-d4c086170320_2","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"huddle\\.|is_dm|is_private|author_id|reply_count|edited_at|user_ids|display_name|avatar_url","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-17.md","caseInsensitive":false,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-4c7c91d3-c485-405f-b495-91b8d1ae3c26-68\nfc_fdef9bd9-125b-9141-a1a2-d4c086170320_2","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"huddle\\.|is_dm|is_private|author_id|reply_count|edited_at|user_ids|display_name|avatar_url","path":"/tmp/designs/MARATHON-17.md","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"../../../../../tmp/designs/MARATHON-17.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":21,"content":"| Threads | Open `thread-panel` for a top-level parent; list replies oldest-first; composer posts with `parent_id`; bump parent `reply_count` UI |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":48,"content":"From **MARATHON-16**: vanilla SPA; `api()` + bearer; `{error:{code,message}}`; `hidden` for unused chrome; hash `#/w/{slug}`; token keys `huddle.token` (+fallbacks); channel rows already expose `data-channel-id` / `data-channel-name`; `#` prefix display for non-DM; `thread-panel` starts hidden.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":50,"content":"From **MARATHON-7**: `ChannelObj` keys `{id,workspace_id,name,is_private,is_dm,topic,is_archived}`; create `POST /api/workspaces/{slug}/channels` body `{name, is_private?, topic?}`; name regex `^[a-z0-9-]{2,32}$`; **409** `conflict` on duplicate name; guests cannot create; only owner/admin create private.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":53,"content":"`{id, channel_id, author_id, author, body, parent_id, reply_count, created_at, edited_at, files, reactions, mentions}`  ","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":54,"content":"(no `seq`); `ReactionObj` `{emoji, count, user_ids}`; POST/GET channel messages; PATCH/DELETE message; GET replies; POST/DELETE reactions; empty body → **400**; archived writes → **423**; list newest-first top-level only; replies oldest-first.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":58,"content":"From **MARATHON-3/4**: nested `author` is `UserObj` (`id, username, display_name, timezone, avatar_url, status_text, status_emoji`).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":83,"content":"| `create-channel-private` | Modal | Optional checkbox/toggle for `is_private` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":110,"content":"| `message-edited` | Visible only when `edited_at != null` (e.g. “Edited”) |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":133,"content":"| `thread-reply-count` | Shows `N replies` (or `N reply`) from parent `reply_count` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":163,"content":"| **Client** | Bearer; body `{name, is_private?: bool, topic?: string}`. Client trims name; strips a leading `#` if the user typed one before send; validates non-empty locally. Disable submit in flight. **201** `{channel}` → append to `channel-list`, close modal, select new channel. **409** → show server `error.message` (or “Channel name already taken”) in `create-channel-error`. **400** → show validation message. **403** → permission error. **401** → M16 logout. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":185,"content":"| **Client** | Top-level: body `{body}` from `message-input` (trim). Empty/whitespace → **do not** call API; show `message-error` (“Message cannot be empty”). Disable submit in flight. **201** `{message}` → append/prepend into list per display order; clear input; hide `empty-channel`. Thread reply: same with `{body, parent_id}`; append to `thread-list`; increment visible parent `reply_count` / `thread-reply-count`. **400** → show server message. **423** → archived lock copy in `message-error` / `thread-error`. **403** → not a member. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":194,"content":"| **Client PATCH** | Author only controls. Body `{body}`; empty → local validation same as post. **200** → replace row body; show `message-edited` from `edited_at`. **409** → remove row / treat deleted. **403** → hide edit. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":195,"content":"| **Client DELETE** | Confirm via `window.confirm` OK. Author or workspace owner (client may approximate: show delete if `author_id === me` OR caller is workspace owner from cached workspace `owner_id`). **200** `{deleted:true}` → remove row from list/thread; if parent deleted while thread open, close thread. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":217,"content":"| **Client** | Opening `emoji-picker` from `message-react-btn` shows a **fixed grid** of at least **8** emoji options (normative starter set: 👍 ❤️ 😂 😮 😢 🎉 ✅ 👀). Choosing an option POSTs that emoji. Clicking an existing `reaction-badge` where `user_ids` contains me → DELETE; else → POST. Replace `reaction-list` from response. Encode emoji in DELETE URL path (`encodeURIComponent`). Never use `prompt()`. |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":237,"content":"| Avatar URL missing | **Client** shows initials from `display_name` or `username` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":259,"content":"{ \"id\": \"…\", \"workspace_id\": \"…\", \"name\": \"eng\", \"is_private\": false, \"is_dm\": false, \"topic\": \"Ship week\", \"is_archived\": false }","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":265,"content":"  \"author_id\": \"…\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":266,"content":"  \"author\": { \"id\": \"…\", \"username\": \"ada\", \"display_name\": \"Ada\", \"timezone\": null, \"avatar_url\": null, \"status_text\": null, \"status_emoji\": null },","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":269,"content":"  \"reply_count\": 0,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":271,"content":"  \"edited_at\": null,","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":273,"content":"  \"reactions\": [{ \"emoji\": \"👍\", \"count\": 1, \"user_ids\": [\"…\"] }],","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":318,"content":"6. Thread panel open/close + replies GET/POST + reply_count bump.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":396,"content":"| `avatar_url` null | Initials avatar; `message-avatar` still present |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":397,"content":"| `display_name` null/empty | Show `username` in `message-author` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":399,"content":"| Thread on message with `reply_count=0` | Panel still opens; empty `thread-list` + composer |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":25,"totalMatchedLines":25,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-4c7c91d3-c485-405f-b495-91b8d1ae3c26-68\nfc_fdef9bd9-125b-9141-a1a2-d4c086170320_2","startedAtMs":"1787448013897","completedAtMs":"1787448013989"},"model_call_id":"03dd848d-d7bd-4877-bfbf-ce6458bc28c6-20-8ogu","session_id":"8d1f97e9-e376-440d-a791-e2992491ec56","timestamp_ms":1787448014011}
